  ["Vuelve a poder ordenar las pestañas."] = "Go back to ordering the tabs.",
  ["Elige qué pestañas no se ven: clic en cada una y luego Hecho. Su página sigue abriéndose desde la AH o el asistente de ruta."] = "Choose which tabs are hidden: click each one, then Done. Their page still opens from the AH or the route assistant.",
  ["Tiene que quedar al menos una pestaña visible."] = "At least one tab must stay visible.",
  ["Lista de compra oculta: ya no tiene pestaña ni brilla al añadirle algo. La lista junto a la Casa de Subastas y la ventana del vendedor siguen igual."] = "Shopping list hidden: it no longer has a tab or glows when something is added. The list next to the Auction House and the vendor window work as before.",
  ["Ordena y oculta las pestañas"] = "Order and hide the tabs",
  ["En opciones, Pestañas: arrastra las pestañas para ordenarlas y oculta las que no uses. El addon se abre en la de arriba."] = "In options, Tabs: drag the tabs to order them and hide the ones you don't use. The addon opens on the top one.",
  ["Sin precio: instala Auctionator"] = "No price: install Auctionator",
  ["No volver a mostrar este consejo"] = "Don't show this tip again",
  ["Precios de tus últimos escaneos. Instala Auctionator para volver a escanear y tener el historial de precios."] = "Prices from your last scans. Install Auctionator to scan again and get the price history.",
  ["Sin precios de este objeto. Instala Auctionator para escanear la AH y ver su evolución."] = "No prices for this item. Install Auctionator to scan the AH and see how it changes.",
  ["Del historial de Auctionator"] = "From Auctionator's history",
  ["De tu escaneo de %s"] = "From your scan %s",
  ["De tu escaneo"] = "From your scan",
  ["Subida sin confirmar: más del triple que el día anterior. No cuenta hasta que se repita otro día."] = "Unconfirmed rise: more than triple the day before. It doesn't count until it repeats another day.",
  ["Día dudoso: mucho más caro que el día de antes y el de después. No cuenta."] = "Doubtful day: much more expensive than the day before and the day after. It doesn't count.",
  ["Subida sin confirmar a %s: no cuenta hasta que se repita otro día."] = "Unconfirmed rise to %s: it doesn't count until it repeats another day.",
  ["Sin precio: búscalo en Auctionator"] = "No price: search for it in Auctionator",
  ["Auctionator aún no tiene precios de este objeto: búscalo o escanea con Auctionator."] = "Auctionator has no prices for this item yet: search for it or scan with Auctionator.",
  ["Auctionator aún no deja otro escaneo completo: espera a que acabe su cuenta atrás."] = "Auctionator doesn't allow another full scan yet: wait for its countdown to finish.",
  ["Instala Auctionator para escanear la AH: el addon lee su escaneo completo."] = "Install Auctionator to scan the AH: the addon reads its full scan.",
  ["Auctionator aún no está listo para escanear: espera un momento o vuelve a abrir la AH."] = "Auctionator isn't ready to scan yet: wait a moment or reopen the AH.",
  [" (con el escaneo de Auctionator)"] = " (with Auctionator's scan)",
  ["Escaneando con Auctionator... %d s"] = "Scanning with Auctionator... %d s",
  ["Con Auctionator: el escaneo lo hace Auctionator (así guarda su historial de precios) y el addon lee esos mismos datos para todas las pestañas."] = "With Auctionator: Auctionator does the scan (so it keeps its price history) and the addon reads that same data for every tab.",
  ["Auctionator ha hecho un escaneo en modo resumen, que Crafter's Journal no usa (solo trae el precio mínimo de cada objeto). Para actualizar el addon, pulsa Escanear en Crafter's Journal, o activa en las opciones de Auctionator «%s»."] = "Auctionator did a summary-mode scan, which Crafter's Journal doesn't use (it only has each item's lowest price). To update the addon, press Scan in Crafter's Journal, or turn on \"%s\" in Auctionator's options.",
  ["Auctionator está en modo resumen: su botón Escanear no actualiza Crafter's Journal. Usa este botón, o activa en las opciones de Auctionator «%s»."] = "Auctionator is in summary mode: its Scan button doesn't update Crafter's Journal. Use this button, or turn on \"%s\" in Auctionator's options.",
  ["Precios del historial de Auctionator: se ponen al día cada vez que escaneas."] = "Prices from Auctionator's history: they update every time you scan.",
  ["Mayús+clic: buscarlo en la AH"] = "Shift+click: search for it on the AH",
